+# Billing disputes
+
+Billing questions are classified for human review by `classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts`.
+
+- A message containing `refund` is classified as `refund-review`.
+- Other invoice questions are classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+These classifications route questions to human review. They do not grant refunds or change invoices.

